# The aarch64 sectoolsv2 signer (sectools/ext/Linux_aarch64/sectools, ~38MB) and the
# kodiak_security_profile.xml ARE committed here — the composer signs with them and must
# work in CI without a BP-repo checkout. Run vendor-sectools.sh to refresh them.
#
# Guard against accidentally committing other large sectools payloads (a full re-vendored
# tree, other-arch binaries): ignore everything under sectools/ except the two tracked paths.
sectools/*
!sectools/kodiak_security_profile.xml
!sectools/ext/
sectools/ext/*
!sectools/ext/Linux_aarch64/
sectools/ext/Linux_aarch64/*
!sectools/ext/Linux_aarch64/sectools
